      "writtenOn": "2023-03-23T16:45:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nice catch! I always forget that CBOR map is actually a multimap.\n\nThe simplest way I could think of to fix this is:\n```\nstd::set\u003cstd::string_view\u003e previousKeys;\nfor (auto\u0026 [key, _] : *parsed) {\n    const std::string\u0026 keyValue \u003d key-\u003easTstr()-\u003evalue();\n    if (!previousKeys.insert(keyValue).second) {\n        error +\u003d \"Err: Duplicate device info entry: \u003c\" + keyValue + \"\u003e,\\n\";\n    }\n    ... existing code ... \n```",
      "parentUuid": "a59b99ab_41599a7e",
      "revId": "b44a7bccc4ec0f1ab104d0e7c3a4484e819f50e2",
